<p>Hey <%= @contact.first_name%>,</p>

<p>
    I'm running a social experiment and would love to have you as part of it...
</p>

<p>
    The gist of it is this: I want to add you to a closed network of my friends and professional contacts. All you have to do is say yes and what you'll get is:
</p>
<ul>
    <li><em>Interview opportunities</em> - I'm going to send out periodic update about members of the network. So you'll meet new people (founders, investors, and creative leaders).</li>
    <li><em>Introductions</em> - When I send out interviews about the network you have the opportunity to contact those people. Don't worry ... it's double opt-in. If your or anybody in my network asks for an intro, the other person has to confirm the intro request for me to personally make that intro. (Yes, I'm making the intros, this isn't fully automated.)</li>
    <li><em>Private events</em> - I plan on hosting private dinners and other events that you are welcome to join!</li>
</ul>
<p>
    All you have to do is reply "I'm in!" and I'll reply back with your personal member number :) Again, this is an experiment but I'd love to have you take part!
</p>
<p>
    ~Nick
</p>